<title>USA: IPO FILING - Mazel Stores Inc.</title>
<headline>IPO FILING - Mazel Stores Inc.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name		    Mazel Stores Inc</p>
<p>Stock symbol			MAZL.O</p>
<p>Estimated price range	   $13-$15/shr</p>
<p>Total shares to be offered    2.145 million</p>
<p>Shrs offered by company	 2.145 million</p>
<p>Shrs offered by shareholders  none Shrs outstanding after ipo    8,355,000</p>
<p>Lead Underwriter    William Blair &amp; Co</p>
<p>Underwriters over-allotment  321,750 shrs</p>
<p>Business: Solon, Ohio,-based company is a</p>
<p>regional closeout retailer and wholesaler.</p>
<p>Use of Proceeds: To repay $19.8 million of</p>
<p>debt, pay $3.6 million promissory note, pay</p>
<p>officers and other entities $1.0 million in</p>
<p>compensation and $2.9 million in tax loans.</p>
<p>Financial Data in 000s, for fiscal year ended January 31:</p>
<p>				   1996		  1995</p>
<p>   - Revenue		 $98,106	     $76,254</p>
<p>   - Net Income		3,099		 4,815</p>
